1
00:00:00,649 --> 00:00:03,899
"Enslaved by warlocks.
Stay here till you roll two, four or..."

2
00:00:04,069 --> 00:00:05,779
(Leonard:)She was mad at him.

3
00:00:06,822 --> 00:00:09,282
(Leonard:)She was done with him,
the relationship was broken...

4
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:12,660
(Leonard:)...and I walked over there and I fixed it.

5
00:00:13,746 --> 00:00:16,626
(Howard:)Boy, that story gets better
every time you hear it.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,750
(Sheldon:)I thought the first two renditions
were far more compelling.

7
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,420
(Sheldon:)Previously, I felt sympathy
for the Leonard character.

8
00:00:23,589 --> 00:00:26,589
(Sheldon:)Now I just find him
to be whiny and annoying.

9
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,970
(Leonard:)Just eat your tangerine chicken.

10
00:00:30,137 --> 00:00:33,017
(Sheldon:)I'd love to,
but I don't have tangerine chicken.

11
00:00:35,518 --> 00:00:39,438
(Penny:)Thank you so much
for your stupid advice.

12
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:45,860
(Raj:)Incredible.

13
00:00:46,028 --> 00:00:48,868
(Raj:)You managed to screw up the screw-up.

14
00:00:51,617 --> 00:00:53,617
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

15
00:00:54,828 --> 00:00:56,158
(Leonard(knocking and entering):)I'm back.

16
00:00:56,789 --> 00:01:00,379
(Penny:)I'm sorry I yelled at you.
It's not your fault.

